{
  "format": "examiner-course",
  "version": 1,
  "id": "demo-early-readers",
  "title": "Early readers demo",
  "description": "A small sample of the early-reader tools: read-aloud lessons and questions, letter sounds, blending and letter tracing. Not a full course.",
  "author": "Erudior",
  "revision": 1,
  "readAloud": true,
  "calculator": "none",
  "audio": {
    "Listen to the bell.": "data:audio/wav;base64,",
    "sound:m": "say:mmm",
    "sound:s": "say:sss",
    "sound:sh": "say:shh"
  },
  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "m1",
      "title": "Reading and writing"
    }
  ],
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "listen",
      "module": "m1",
      "title": "Listen and count",
      "minutes": 5,
      "topics": [
        "Numbers"
      ],
      "quiz": [
        "q-add",
        "q-abc"
      ],
      "body": "Every part of this lesson can be read to you. Press **Read the lesson to me**, or the speaker button beside any part.\n\n## Counting\n\nWe count one, two, three, four, five.\n\n- Two apples and three apples make five apples.\n- Write it like this: $2 + 3 = 5$.\n- Half of a pizza is $\\frac{1}{2}$ of it.\n\n## A recording\n\nListen to the bell.\n\nThat sentence plays a recording from the course instead of the computer's voice."
    },
    {
      "id": "sounds",
      "module": "m1",
      "title": "Letter sounds",
      "minutes": 5,
      "topics": [
        "Letter sounds"
      ],
      "quiz": [
        "q-sun"
      ],
      "body": "Each letter makes a sound. Tap a letter to hear it, then tap the word.\n\n```sounds\nMm word=moon\nSs word=sun\nAa word=apple say=\"a, as in apple\"\nTt word=top\nsh word=ship\n```\n\nThe sounds of m, s and sh come from the course's audio list. A real course gives every sound a recording."
    },
    {
      "id": "blend",
      "module": "m1",
      "title": "Blending sounds",
      "minutes": 5,
      "topics": [
        "Blending"
      ],
      "quiz": [
        "q-cat",
        "q-ship"
      ],
      "body": "Put sounds together to read a word. Tap each sound, then blend them.\n\n```blend\ncat = c a t\nsun = s u n\nmap = m a p\nship = sh i p\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "trace",
      "module": "m1",
      "title": "Tracing letters",
      "minutes": 10,
      "topics": [
        "Handwriting"
      ],
      "body": "Start at the number 1. Follow the arrow and stay on the path.\n\n```trace\na b c A B C\n```\n\n## Every letter\n\nPractice any letter. This pad is a little easier to stay on.\n\n```trace tolerance=loose\nabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz\nABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ\n```"
    }
  ],
  "banks": [
